1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,322
Fruits and Vegetables with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,622 --> 00:00:09,070
Mimo: Hi friends! Today we're making a super healthy fruit salad!

3
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:13,362
Mimo: Fruits and vegetables help us grow big and strong!

4
00:00:13,662 --> 00:00:16,939
Bruno: Big and strong? Like me? Then I want lots of fruit salad!

5
00:00:17,239 --> 00:00:21,884
Mimo: Let's learn the names of the fruits as we put them in the bowl. Ready?

6
00:00:22,184 --> 00:00:27,360
Mimo: First, an apple! A red, crunchy apple. Can you say apple?

7
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,221
Mimo: Into the bowl it goes!

8
00:00:32,221 --> 00:00:36,832
Mimo: Next, a banana! Long and yellow. Can you say banana?

9
00:00:38,732 --> 00:00:40,627
Bruno: I'll put the banana in the bowl!

10
00:00:43,049 --> 00:00:45,359
Mimo: Bruno! You ate the banana!

11
00:00:45,659 --> 00:00:47,369
Bruno: Oops. It jumped into my mouth.

12
00:00:49,669 --> 00:00:55,897
Mimo: Here's a strawberry! Red and sweet, with tiny seeds. Can you say strawberry?

13
00:00:57,797 --> 00:01:00,586
Bruno: I'll put the strawberry in the bowl! I promise!

14
00:01:02,486 --> 00:01:03,356
Mimo: Bruno!

15
00:01:03,656 --> 00:01:06,376
Bruno: It was so small! It fell right into my mouth!

16
00:01:07,854 --> 00:01:11,119
Pip: Hi! I'll help so Bruno doesn't eat everything!

17
00:01:11,419 --> 00:01:15,450
Pip: This is an orange! It's round, and its color is orange too!

18
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:17,331
Mimo: Can you say orange?

19
00:01:20,373 --> 00:01:21,282
Pip: In the bowl!

20
00:01:22,282 --> 00:01:27,642
Mimo: Grapes! Little and purple, and they come in a bunch! Can you say grapes?

21
00:01:29,542 --> 00:01:30,590
Pip: Into the bowl!

22
00:01:31,590 --> 00:01:39,637
Mimo: And a big, juicy watermelon! Green on the outside, red on the inside. Can you say watermelon?

23
00:01:41,537 --> 00:01:43,740
Bruno: That one is too big to eat in one bite.

24
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,436
Bruno: ...I'll try anyway!

25
00:01:51,736 --> 00:01:54,641
Pip: Bruno! Your face is all red and juicy!

26
00:01:54,941 --> 00:01:58,896
Mimo: Now some vegetables! This one is my favorite.

27
00:01:59,196 --> 00:02:05,012
Mimo: A carrot! Orange and crunchy. Bunnies love carrots! Can you say carrot?

28
00:02:08,512 --> 00:02:12,511
Mimo: Oops! Now I ate one! Bunnies can't help it.

29
00:02:14,811 --> 00:02:16,603
Bruno: Ha! Now you know how I feel!

30
00:02:16,903 --> 00:02:21,926
Mimo: And broccoli! It looks like a tiny tree. Can you say broccoli?

31
00:02:23,826 --> 00:02:26,035
Bruno: Broccoli? Hmm. I'll let Pip have that one.

32
00:02:27,935 --> 00:02:30,097
Pip: Yum! Broccoli makes me strong!

33
00:02:31,697 --> 00:02:36,110
Mimo: Our fruit salad is ready! Let's name everything in the bowl!

34
00:02:36,410 --> 00:02:37,313
Mimo: Apple!

35
00:02:38,213 --> 00:02:39,094
Pip: Orange!

36
00:02:39,994 --> 00:02:40,935
Mimo: Grapes!

37
00:02:41,835 --> 00:02:42,864
Pip: Watermelon!

38
00:02:43,764 --> 00:02:45,461
Bruno: And banana! The one I ate!

39
00:02:45,761 --> 00:02:50,978
Mimo: Great job, friends! Fruits and vegetables are delicious and healthy!

40
00:02:52,578 --> 00:02:54,484
Bruno: Can we have fruit salad every day?

41
00:02:54,784 --> 00:02:58,561
Mimo: Yes! As long as you save some for everybody!

42
00:03:00,361 --> 00:03:05,485
Mimo: Next time, let's talk about feelings! Bye bye, friends!
